Question: Can a balancing service provider still update its balancing energy bid after gate closure?

Answer: No. Under EU law, a balancing service provider **cannot** update its balancing energy bid after the gate closure time.

According to **Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/2195** (the Electricity Balancing Guideline), Article 24(3) explicitly states:
> *"After the balancing energy gate closure time, the balancing service providers shall no longer be permitted to submit or update their balancing energy bids."* 

The regulation further defines the **balancing energy gate closure time** in Article 2(27) as *"the point in time when submission or update of a balancing energy bid for a standard product on a common merit order list is no longer permitted"* (consolidated version of 2022-06-19).

**What happens after gate closure?**
